{"id":"814b17f1550bcf38","group":"27","path":"27/27-df-monodnf.md","title":"Positive (increasing-monotone) DNF","display":"df-monodnf — Positive (increasing-monotone) DNF","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-df-monodnf","aliases":["27-df-monodnf"],"display":"df-monodnf — Positive (increasing-monotone) DNF","depends_on":["[[27-df-dnf]]","[[27-df-litset]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-df-monodnf"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-df-monodnf</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-monodnf — Positive (increasing-monotone) DNF"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0b618255959ff4bc\" href=\"?note=0b618255959ff4bc\" title=\"27-df-dnf\">27-df-dnf</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8311e93eaac6c631\" href=\"?note=8311e93eaac6c631\" title=\"27-df-litset\">27-df-litset</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[n]=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}\">\\([n]=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}\\)</span>; <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb B=\\{0,1\\}\">\\(\\mathbb B=\\{0,1\\}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n=\\mathbb B^{\\mathbb B^n}\">\\(\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n=\\mathbb B^{\\mathbb B^n}\\)</span>, as in <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5d10aed668d85817\" href=\"?note=5d10aed668d85817\" title=\"27-df-boolfunc\">27-df-boolfunc</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x_i(a)=a_i\">\\(x_i(a)=a_i\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inlin